i have a question, can you help me please

-

You can't have a true if followed by an else. That's not valid lua syntax (and it wouldn't even work anyway). But what you actually want is an elseif clause. Something like this:

   if 1==0 then
      print("false")
   elseif 2==3 then
      print("something")
   end


